OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear skies initially, allowing
OL,7,Ftemperatures to drop away. Cloud
OL,8,Fbuilds through the night, bringing
OL,9,Frain and drizzle in from the east
OL,10,Fthrough the early hours.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA wet start for most, except
OL,13,Fin the far west of the country. Rain
OL,14,Fslowly turning more showery in the
OL,15,Feast with brighter skies developing
OL,16,Ffor some, chiefly in Pembrokeshire.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
