OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHeavy
OL,6,Fshowers with coastal gales on
OL,7,FWednesday. Sunny spells and lighter
OL,8,Fwinds into Thursday before turning
OL,9,Fvery unsettled overnight. Severe gales
OL,10,Fand heavy rain likely on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
